# Input graph for the `historique_path` parameter of `visualisation` (see driver.py).
# Holds 2 instance(s) of :Generation, the class the region's query on g_historique selects,
# and a neighbourhood that this query must not match: instances of the five
# other tracked classes (so a query wired to the wrong graph, or a file parsed
# into the wrong graph, changes the result), the class reached by another
# predicate than rdf:type, and a same-named class in another namespace.
@prefix : <http://dig.isi.edu/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:historique_1 a :Generation .
:historique_2 a :Generation .

:tache_in_historique a :Tache .
:activite_in_historique a :Activite .
:phenomene_in_historique a :Phenomene_Metier .
:domaine_in_historique a :Domaine .
:strategie_in_historique a :Strategie .
:historique_seeAlso rdfs:seeAlso :Generation .
<http://other.example/historique_9> a <http://other.example/Generation> .
